	<paragraphs>
		<title>Isomorphisms</title>
		
    <p>
       We conjectured in a weekly practice problem that <m>\mathbb{Z}_6</m> was essentially the same as <m>\mathbb{Z}_2 \oplus \mathbb{Z}_3</m>.
	</p>

